WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.230
Sam wants to say "I
am studying Spanish".

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.890
So Sam builds it word by
word: Soy estudio español.

3
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.470
The teacher crosses
out the first word.

4
00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:14.210
Lucía writes just two
words: Estudio español.

5
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.050
And her sentence can
mean "I study Spanish",

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:21.390
"I am studying Spanish",
even "I do study Spanish".

7
00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:24.510
So where did the "I" and the "am" go?

8
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:28.390
In this mission, you'll meet
the six persons every verb has,

9
00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.800
from "I" to "they".

10
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:35.130
You'll build regular verbs like
these: hablar, comer, vivir.

11
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.470
And you'll spot where the last
two go their separate ways.

12
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:42.250
Your mission: track down
the missing "I" and "am".
